Route21_North_Text_RonaldIntro::
	.string "Fish gather where PALLET's quiet\n"
	.string "water starts to deepen.\p"
	.string "Keep still, or battle me!$"

Route21_North_Text_RonaldDefeat::
	.string "Line snapped!$"

Route21_North_Text_RonaldPostBattle::
	.string "Most people rush south toward\n"
	.string "CINNABAR.\p"
	.string "I like the north end. It rewards\n"
	.string "patience.$"

Route21_North_Text_WadeIntro::
	.string "The ferry stirs up the water\n"
	.string "when it leaves PALLET.\p"
	.string "That's when I cast my line!$"

Route21_North_Text_WadeDefeat::
	.string "My timing missed the wake!$"

Route21_North_Text_WadePostBattle::
	.string "A little wake can bring fish up\n"
	.string "from deeper water.\p"
	.string "The trick is knowing when the\n"
	.string "sea is about to move.$"

Route21_North_Text_SpencerIntro::
	.string "ROUTE 21 starts gentle, then\n"
	.string "keeps pulling south.\p"
	.string "I'll match that current!$"

Route21_North_Text_SpencerDefeat::
	.string "Swept south!$"

Route21_North_Text_SpencerPostBattle::
	.string "From here you can still imagine\n"
	.string "PALLET behind you.\p"
	.string "A few strokes later, it's only\n"
	.string "you and the water.$"

Route21_North_Text_SeagallopSailorGreeting::
	.string "Ahoy! Heading for CINNABAR\n"
	.string "ISLAND?\p"
	.string "Want to sail there now?$"

Route21_North_Text_SeagallopSailorAllAboard::
	.string "Alright, all aboard!\n"
	.string "We set sail!$"

Route21_North_Text_FerryLandingSign::
	.string "PALLET TOWN - ROUTE 21\n"
	.string "FERRY LANDING$"

Route21_North_Text_FatManNeedPokemon::
	.string "I got too excited about going to\n"
	.string "the beach...\p"
	.string "And now I'm stuck between these\n"
	.string "fences!\p"
	.string "Don't help me!\n"
	.string "I'll get unstuck by myself!$"

Route21_North_Text_AnyaIntro::
	.string "This stretch links PALLET's quiet\n"
	.string "shore to the open southern sea.\p"
	.string "Let's see how you handle the\n"
	.string "first pull of the route.$"

Route21_North_Text_AnyaRematchIntro::
	.string "Back on ROUTE 21?\p"
	.string "Let's see if the current has made\n"
	.string "you stronger!$"

Route21_North_Text_AnyaDefeat::
	.string "The tide turned!$"

Route21_North_Text_AnyaPostBattle::
	.string "The north water feels gentler,\n"
	.string "but it still leads to CINNABAR.\p"
	.string "Every current here knows where\n"
	.string "it's going.$"

@ Below is the battle text for the Cue Ball that was on Route 21 in Gen 1.
@ This trainer wasnt used in Gen 3 so their text goes unused/untranslated
@ Interestingly they did add a rematch intro text for this trainer
@ English translations from RB are listed

@ "What's wrong with me swimming?"
Route21_North_Text_CueBallIntro::
	.string "おれだって　たまには\n"
	.string "およぎに　くるぜ！$"

@ "Cheap shot!"
Route21_North_Text_CueBallDefeat::
	.string "ぐわわ！$"

@ "I look like what? A studded inner tube? Get lost!"
Route21_North_Text_CueBallPostBattle::
	.string "うきやすそう　だと？\n"
	.string "うるせー　おおきな　おせわだッ！$"

Route21_North_Text_NavigationSeaJunction::
	.string "SEA ROUTE 21\n"
	.string "NORTH: PALLET TOWN\p"
	.string "SOUTH: CINNABAR ISLAND\n"
	.string "EAST: ROUTE 18$"

Route21_South_Text_JackIntro::
	.string "I caught my POKéMON in the long\n"
	.string "water north of CINNABAR.\p"
	.string "They know this route's rhythm!$"

Route21_South_Text_JackDefeat::
	.string "Dragged under!$"

Route21_South_Text_JackPostBattle::
	.string "Route 21 changes as you go south.\p"
	.string "The water near CINNABAR feels\n"
	.string "warmer and heavier.$"

Route21_South_Text_JeromeIntro::
	.string "I'm timing my swim from PALLET\n"
	.string "all the way to CINNABAR.\p"
	.string "Battle me without breaking pace!$"

Route21_South_Text_JeromeDefeat::
	.string "Lost my pace!$"

Route21_South_Text_JeromePostBattle::
	.string "This route is long enough to\n"
	.string "turn confidence into fatigue.\p"
	.string "That's why I train here.$"

Route21_South_Text_RolandIntro::
	.string "Feel that sea breeze?\p"
	.string "CINNABAR is close enough to\n"
	.string "change the air!$"

Route21_South_Text_RolandDefeat::
	.string "The breeze dropped!$"

Route21_South_Text_RolandPostBattle::
	.string "The sun hits different near\n"
	.string "volcanic rock.\p"
	.string "No wonder swimmers slow down\n"
	.string "before CINNABAR.$"

Route21_South_Text_ClaudeIntro::
	.string "Hey, don't scare away the fish!\p"
	.string "The CINNABAR current makes them\n"
	.string "bite in strange patterns.$"

Route21_South_Text_ClaudeDefeat::
	.string "There goes the bite!$"

Route21_South_Text_ClaudePostBattle::
	.string "The water rolls differently near\n"
	.string "CINNABAR.\p"
	.string "Fish know it. Fishermen are still\n"
	.string "trying to learn.$"

Route21_South_Text_NolanIntro::
	.string "Keep me company till I get a hit.\p"
	.string "Or better yet, battle me while\n"
	.string "the line is quiet.$"

Route21_South_Text_NolanDefeat::
	.string "Hook slipped!$"

Route21_South_Text_NolanPostBattle::
	.string "Oh wait!\n"
	.string "I got a bite! Yeah!\p"
	.string "Route 21 makes you wait, but it\n"
	.string "doesn't forget you.$"

Route21_South_Text_NicoleIntro::
	.string "CINNABAR's warm water meets the\n"
	.string "cooler sea here.\p"
	.string "That's my favorite training spot,\n"
	.string "and my favorite battle spot!$"

Route21_South_Text_NicoleRematchIntro::
	.string "The water's different every time.\p"
	.string "So is my battling!$"

Route21_South_Text_NicoleDefeat::
	.string "I lost my rhythm in the current.$"

Route21_South_Text_NicolePostBattle::
	.string "The island changes the current.\n"
	.string "You can feel it before you see it.\p"
	.string "That's how you know CINNABAR is\n"
	.string "close.$"

Route21_South_Text_SeagallopSailorDestination::
	.string "Ahoy! Leaving CINNABAR\n"
	.string "ISLAND?\p"
	.string "Where would you like to sail?$"

Route21_South_Text_SeagallopSailorAllAboard::
	.string "Alright, all aboard!\n"
	.string "We set sail!$"

Route21_North_Text_LilIntro::
	.string "LIL: We're practising the swim\n"
	.string "from PALLET.\p"
	.string "IAN says we have to battle as a\n"
	.string "team too.$"

Route21_North_Text_LilDefeat::
	.string "LIL: The current won that one!$"

Route21_North_Text_LilPostBattle::
	.string "LIL: The sea feels less scary\n"
	.string "when IAN swims beside me.$"

Route21_North_Text_LilNotEnoughMons::
	.string "LIL: We only battle together.\p"
	.string "Bring two POKéMON, won't you?$"

Route21_North_Text_IanIntro::
	.string "IAN: LIL keeps us steady when\n"
	.string "the route starts pulling south.\p"
	.string "I'll show you how we battle!$"

Route21_North_Text_IanDefeat::
	.string "IAN: We got pulled apart!$"

Route21_North_Text_IanPostBattle::
	.string "IAN: PALLET feels far away once\n"
	.string "you're in the middle of Route 21.\p"
	.string "That's why we practise together.$"

Route21_North_Text_IanNotEnoughMons::
	.string "IAN: LIL and I battle together.\p"
	.string "Bring two POKéMON before you\n"
	.string "challenge us, okay?$"
